{"sections":[{"slug":"Pontryagin数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Pontryagin数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Pontryagin <span lang=\"zh\">数</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Pontryagin 数”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对所有序列</span> $I=(i_1,\\cdots,i_k)$, <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Pontryagin类","text":"Pontryagin <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":" $p_I=p_{i_1}\\cdots p_{i_k}$, Pontryagin <span lang=\"zh\">数可视为映射</span>\n$$\r\np_I\\colon \\Omega \\to\\mathbb Z,\r\n[M]\\mapsto \\left&lt;p_I(M),[M]\\right&gt;,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">因为它是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/配边","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">配边</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">不变量</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}